{"title": "Legendary Action: Draconic Wrath", "pageid": 32390, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Draconic_Wrath", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp, /w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Draconic Wrath</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Ansur\" title=\"Ansur\">Ansur</a>, that lets him use a <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Legendary action\">legendary action</a> to react with his <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Breath_(Ansur)\" title=\"Lightning Breath (Ansur)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Breath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Breath_(Ansur)\" title=\"Lightning Breath (Ansur)\">Lightning Breath</a> once per round after being attacked\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The dragon can retaliate against an attacker with its breath weapon once per round. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Draconic_Wrath\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Draconic Wrath </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Draconic_Wrath_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Draconic Wrath (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Draconic_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Draconic_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Draconic_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Draconic_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Draconic_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Draconic_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Draconic Wrath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Draconic_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Draconic_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Draconic_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Draconic_Wrath_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Draconic Wrath (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Draconic Wrath</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>This great drake will use its <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Breath_(Ansur)\" title=\"Lightning Breath (Ansur)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Breath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Breath_(Ansur)\" title=\"Lightning Breath (Ansur)\">Lightning Breath</a> on the next creature that attacks it.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ansur\" title=\"Ansur\">Ansur</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202806\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1019/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9201/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3513/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 118/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643724/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.837      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   37.837      1 -total\n 44.64%